@startuml subsistema_frontend
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle uml2

package "Interfaz de Usuario (React + Vite)" {
  [Terminal\n(xterm.js)] as Terminal
  [ChatPane\n(Asistente IA)] as Chat
  [Gestor SFTP\n(FileManager)] as SFTP
  [Escritorio VNC\n(VncViewer)] as VNC
  [Monitoreo\n(Raspberry/Dashboard)] as Dasbhoard
  [Prácticas Lab\n(Practicas)] as Practicas

  [Gestor de Estado\n(React Context/Hooks)] as StateManager
}

Terminal <--> StateManager
Chat <--> StateManager
SFTP <--> StateManager
VNC <--> StateManager
Dasbhoard <--> StateManager
Practicas <--> StateManager

StateManager <--> [Tauri API Bridge] : Comunicación Async (Rust)
@enduml
